{
  "_about": "Approximate lifetime annualized failure rates (AFR %) per drive model, compiled from Backblaze's public Drive Stats reports (backblaze.com/cloud-storage/resources/hard-drive-test-data). Values are rounded approximations for guidance only. Override or extend by placing a file with the same structure at /data/model_stats.json. 'match' is a case-insensitive regex tested against the model name.",
